@startuml
title Activity Diagram: Book Room (Smart Campus)

start

:Receive booking request\n(room, start time, end time);
note right
  A1: touching bookings (12:00 end,
  12:00 start) do NOT overlap
  A2: blocking a room keeps its existing
  bookings; it only stops new ones
end note

if (Start in future and 0 < duration <= 2 h? (R1)) then ([yes])
else ([no])
  :Reject booking: invalid time range;
  stop
endif

if (Room blocked? (R3)) then ([no])
else ([yes])
  :Reject booking: room is blocked;
  stop
endif

if (Overlaps an ACTIVE booking of this room? (R2)) then ([no])
else ([yes])
  :Reject booking: time slot taken;
  stop
endif

:Create Booking (status ACTIVE);
:Issue Confirmation (R4);
:Show confirmation to student;
stop
@enduml
